Adding an Internet Control Message Protocol
(ICMP) check
The first check we're going to implement is one of the most popular ones: an Internet
Control Message Protocol (ICMP) request check to an external host, also known as
PING.
As we most likely already know, a PING request is a rather basic way to check the
presence — and therefore the availability — of a server that we know we should be able

