}
Here we go: as we can see, another advantage of being able to programmatically
configure the host is that we can add the ICMP health check multiple times — one for
each host we'd like to actually check. In the preceding example, we're taking the
chance to test three different hosts: www.ryadel.com, www.google.com, and the
same non-existing host we used before, which allows us to emulate an

